        },
        {
          "name": "Alloc Type",
          "type": "ELLMAllocType",
          "default": "ELLMAllocType::None"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Records an allocation or release of memory by a system that is not directly associated with a single pointer.\n@param Tracker Which tracker to use, the high-level default tracker for regular engine allocations, or the\nlow-level platform tracker for memory management systems.\n@param DeltaMemory The amount of memory that was allocated (positive) or freed (negative)\n@param DefaultTag The tag to use if there is no tag already in scope on the callstack.\n@param AllocType Type of allocation, FMalloc for regular allocations done through GMalloc, System for others."
    },
